nReleaseDate": "2026-10-28T19:33:40Z", "primaryGenreName": "Health & Fitness", "primaryGenreId": 6013, "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled": true, "releaseNotes": "\u2022 Progress: your goal percentage now displays correctly.\n\u2022 Performance and stability improvements.", "version": "1.3", "wrapperType": "software", "currency": "SAR", "description": "Grams is a training and nutrition app for Arabic and English speakers, where everything is measured rather than guessed.\n\nLOG A MEAL IN SECONDS\n\u2022 Photograph it \u2014 including Gulf dishes like kabsa and shawarma, recognised as dishes rather than broken into \"chicken and rice\"\n\u2022 Or just say it: \"two eggs, toast and a coffee\" \u2014 type it or speak it, in Arabic or English\n\u2022 Portions in the units you actually use: 2 eggs, 1 cup, 3 slices. Grams are there too, for anyone who weighs their food\n\u2022 Every estimate is yours to correct before it is saved, and afterwards\n\nTRAIN\n\u2022 18 structured programmes, from your first week in a gym to advanced splits\n\u2022 Filter by level and by the equipment you have\n\u2022 Programmes built for women \u2014 yoga, pilates, and work around the hips and core\n\u2022 Every exercise carries a demonstration clip, so you see the movement before you do it\n\u2022 Log your sets and weights as you go; the app remembers exactly where you stopped\n\nEAT\n\u2022 Calorie and protein targets calculated from your body, your goal and how you actually live\n\u2022 Meal plans that respect halal, vegetarian, allergies, and the foods you simply do not like\n\nBOTH LANGUAGES, PROPERLY\nArabic and English are equal here. The app is fully right-to-left in Arabic, with Arabic numerals and Arabic food names \u2014 not an English app with translated buttons.\n\nGRAMS PRO\nGrams is a subscription app. New members start with a 7-day free trial of the yearly plan, which includes every programme, meal plans and meal scanning.\n\u2022 After the free trial, the yearly plan is charged to your Apple account and renews automatically each year\n\u2022 Cancel at least 24 hours before the trial or the year ends to avoid being charged, in your Apple ID settings\n\u2022 Deleting the app does not cancel a subscription\n\nGrams is not medical advice. Talk to your doctor before making a major change to your training or your diet.\n\nTERMS AND PRIVACY\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nGrams terms: https://grams.fit/terms\nPrivacy policy: https://grams.fit/privacy", "sellerUrl": "https://grams.fit", "languageCodesISO2A": ["AR", "EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "6233088", "formattedPrice": "Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 24, "trackContentRating": "4+", "averageUserRating": 4.41667, "bundleId": "fit.grams.app", "trackCensoredName": "Grams \u2014 Train & Eat", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/sa/app/grams-train-eat/id6809578269?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "genreIds": ["6013", "6023"], "userRatingCount": 24}